office","title":"安成長","mode":"attestation","status":"source_attested","effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"本句所載職官，任免時間未詳。","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-060","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-060-lvdai","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-060-lvdai","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-060-lvdai:line047","quote":"　　建安二十年，督孫茂等十將從取長沙三郡。又安成、攸、永新、茶陵四縣吏共入陰山城，合眾拒岱，岱攻圍，即降，三郡克定。權留岱鎮長沙。安成長吳碭及中郎將袁龍等首尾關羽，復為反亂。碭據攸縣，龍在醴陵。權遣橫江將軍魯肅攻攸，碭得突走。岱攻醴陵，遂禽斬龍。遷廬陵太守。","person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-060-lvdai:line047:m0068"}],"attestations":[{"id":"t-wu060-t-wu060-lvdai6:a","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-060-lvdai:line047","person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-060-lvdai:line047:m0068","start":65,"end":68,"surface":"安成長","usage":"narrative","date_expression":null}],"human_reviewed":false,"reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","model":null}],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-060-lvdai:line047","text":"　　建安二十年，督孫茂等十將從取長沙三郡。又安成、攸、永新、茶陵四縣吏共入陰山城，合眾拒岱，岱攻圍，即降，三郡克定。權留岱鎮長沙。安成長吳碭及中郎將袁龍等首尾關羽，復為反亂。碭據攸縣，龍在醴陵。權遣橫江將軍魯肅攻攸，碭得突走。岱攻醴陵，遂禽斬龍。遷廬陵太守。","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-060-lvdai:line047:m0009","start":9,"end":11,"surface":"孫茂","kind":"person","person_id":"0u0_v1h_v8v","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-060-lvdai:line047:m0044","start":44,"end":45,"surface":"岱","kind":"person","person_id":"2oe_qam_pq4","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-060-lvdai:line047:m0046","start":46,"end":47,"surface":"岱","kind":"person","person_id":"2oe_qam_pq4","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-060-lvdai:line047:m0058","start":58,"